WEBVTT

00:02:46.420 --> 00:02:48.320
So, you have come,

00:02:49.690 --> 00:02:51.120
Yushiro.

00:02:51.120 --> 00:02:53.530
How? How did you know about me?

00:02:53.530 --> 00:02:55.490
Because I have been waiting for you.

00:02:55.490 --> 00:02:56.860
Waiting for me?

00:02:56.860 --> 00:03:00.200
Yes, together with the kugai,

00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:02.200
waiting for you to come.

00:03:02.200 --> 00:03:03.300
Who are you?

00:03:03.300 --> 00:03:04.870
I am no one significant.

00:03:04.870 --> 00:03:07.410
A simple guardian of a grave.

00:03:07.410 --> 00:03:10.280
A man who simply guards this
kugai and the threshold.

00:03:10.280 --> 00:03:13.180
That is all.

00:03:13.180 --> 00:03:17.580
I stand here and watch time envelop
the sound of voices.

00:03:18.380 --> 00:03:21.650
Listen to them with your heart.

00:03:22.350 --> 00:03:24.190
The beat of the kugai's rhythm!

00:03:48.750 --> 00:03:50.880
An edict! An Imperial Edict!

00:03:50.880 --> 00:03:54.280
An edict has been passed down
to the Watanabe faction!

00:03:57.390 --> 00:04:00.650
Light rises to shower brightness
upon the Earth,

00:04:01.190 --> 00:04:05.390
while the shadow sinks below and
envelopes everything in darkness.

00:04:06.500 --> 00:04:09.570
As the great king descends
upon the land of Yamato

00:04:09.570 --> 00:04:13.270
and moves to rule over the sixty-six
lands of Akitsushima,

00:04:13.270 --> 00:04:18.110
the Kugutsu will come to his
aid with their oni powers.

00:04:25.720 --> 00:04:27.290
An edict?

00:04:27.290 --> 00:04:29.020
It's from the Emperor

00:04:29.020 --> 00:04:31.010
telling us to hand over the kugai.

00:04:31.720 --> 00:04:33.530
And what do you plan to do?

00:04:33.530 --> 00:04:36.560
Eight hundred years have passed
since the time of the great wars,

00:04:36.560 --> 00:04:39.930
and three hundred since new gods
were invited to the Imperial Court.

00:04:39.930 --> 00:04:45.460
Even our clan has almost forgotten
the ceremony of Gasaraki.

00:04:46.270 --> 00:04:47.930
You intend to comply?

00:04:50.940 --> 00:04:53.040
You disapprove?

00:04:53.780 --> 00:04:56.180
You propose to ignore the edict?

00:04:56.950 --> 00:04:58.220
Indeed!

00:04:58.220 --> 00:05:01.690
Three hundred years ago, this nation
took its current shape.

00:05:01.690 --> 00:05:05.990
The era when we were the leaders
of ceremonial affairs of war

00:05:05.990 --> 00:05:07.650
has long passed.

00:05:08.190 --> 00:05:12.830
We are no longer the shadow powers
that support the Emperor.

00:05:12.830 --> 00:05:16.770
We are mere royal guardians now,
intimate protectors of the Court.

00:05:16.770 --> 00:05:19.570
We must return to our old ways!

00:05:20.210 --> 00:05:22.470
After establishing its authority
and power,

00:05:22.470 --> 00:05:27.550
the Court has forgotten us,
nay, they loath us,

00:05:27.550 --> 00:05:30.720
we, who fought on their
behalf with our lives.

00:05:30.720 --> 00:05:33.090
We must make them remember
once again

00:05:33.090 --> 00:05:35.050
what we are to them, our true form.

00:05:35.050 --> 00:05:36.790
You believe this can be done?

00:05:36.790 --> 00:05:39.290
Alone, against everyone
else in this nation?

00:05:39.290 --> 00:05:40.260
Indeed!

00:05:41.090 --> 00:05:46.500
Yet, I fear no words from me can
persuade you of this truth.

00:05:46.500 --> 00:05:49.400
You intend to confront
me no matter what?

00:05:50.070 --> 00:05:51.730
Yes, even if it means my death!

00:05:53.670 --> 00:05:56.710
Since antiquity, we the
Kugutsu, have relied

00:05:56.710 --> 00:06:01.270
upon the kugai to resolve
feuds within our clan.

00:06:02.150 --> 00:06:06.740
It appears that the time for
this has come once again.

00:06:07.550 --> 00:06:11.320
In the end, the light and the darkness
never can make amends.

00:06:12.090 --> 00:06:15.360
Either the light scatters
the darkness

00:06:15.360 --> 00:06:18.520
or the darkness consumes the light.

00:06:19.460 --> 00:06:22.920
The kugai, the source of the
Kugutsu's power...

00:06:23.470 --> 00:06:27.030
We must deprive them of
their source of power.

00:06:27.740 --> 00:06:31.870
We must reign over them, our rule
absolute over all in this land.

00:06:32.780 --> 00:06:37.110
All is for the sake of my
dear precious child.

00:09:28.290 --> 00:09:30.020
The time has arrived once again!

00:09:58.580 --> 00:10:00.050
Victory!

00:10:27.150 --> 00:10:28.680
Why does he not take the head?

00:10:28.680 --> 00:10:30.450
Thrust with your sword!

00:10:30.450 --> 00:10:31.920
Have you lost your nerve?

00:10:31.920 --> 00:10:34.450
The ceremony is only complete
with the beheading!

00:10:34.450 --> 00:10:35.890
Complete your duty!

00:10:35.890 --> 00:10:37.760
Behead her!

00:10:37.760 --> 00:10:39.220
What's the matter?

00:10:48.800 --> 00:10:50.390
The ceremony has been disrupted!

00:10:51.900 --> 00:10:54.840
The kai has abandoned
his duty as a kai,

00:10:54.840 --> 00:10:56.430
and has disrupted the ceremony!

00:10:57.380 --> 00:10:59.710
That man is no longer a kai!

00:11:00.450 --> 00:11:01.940
This is a shortcoming on your end!

00:11:04.820 --> 00:11:05.850
What's the matter?

00:11:05.850 --> 00:11:07.250
Why won't you take her head?

00:11:07.250 --> 00:11:09.220
Well, Yushiro?

00:11:09.220 --> 00:11:10.690
Is he without shame?

00:11:18.560 --> 00:11:20.030
Father!

00:11:20.930 --> 00:11:23.090
Father! Father!

00:11:24.740 --> 00:11:26.570
The gods have spoken!

00:11:27.210 --> 00:11:30.210
Anyone who dares to oppose me,
step forward!

00:11:30.210 --> 00:11:33.510
Thou kai, I am your master now!

00:11:46.260 --> 00:11:47.730
Someone!

00:11:49.360 --> 00:11:50.960
Dispatch a message.

00:11:50.960 --> 00:11:54.520
All members of the Watanabe faction
assemble at my estate at once.

00:12:02.540 --> 00:12:03.340
Why?

00:12:06.040 --> 00:12:07.510
Why?

00:12:09.150 --> 00:12:10.610
Why did I stop?

00:12:11.950 --> 00:12:14.820
Why? Why did I stop?

00:12:28.870 --> 00:12:30.630
A feud within the Watanabe faction?

00:12:32.200 --> 00:12:35.240
Lord Kiou intended to
heed the edict,

00:12:35.240 --> 00:12:37.140
but his subordinate by the
name of Tsuna...

00:12:37.940 --> 00:12:39.340
Tsuna killed Kiou?

00:12:39.340 --> 00:12:40.210
Yes, Sir!

00:12:40.210 --> 00:12:41.780
Interesting.

00:12:41.780 --> 00:12:43.680
It appears we need not
conspire any further

00:12:43.680 --> 00:12:48.480
to have the Watanabe faction
bring the kugai to us.

00:13:01.530 --> 00:13:06.940
Alas, I trust all those assembled
know of my intentions,

00:13:07.770 --> 00:13:10.810
but I first would like to hear your
thoughts on this matter.

00:13:10.810 --> 00:13:13.550
Our thoughts? So you say!

00:13:13.550 --> 00:13:16.640
What is the purpose of hearing
us speak our thoughts?

00:13:17.750 --> 00:13:21.740
A traitor is among us, an informer
tied to the Court.

00:13:24.760 --> 00:13:28.720
But admonishment is not my
concern at this time.

00:13:29.330 --> 00:13:35.000
Alas, we must be of one spirit,
and rally together as one.

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:35.970
Rally?

00:13:36.900 --> 00:13:39.770
Have you not wondered why the
Emperor has demanded

00:13:39.770 --> 00:13:42.000
that the kugai be handed to
him at this juncture?

00:13:45.710 --> 00:13:47.710
Since the time when the new
gods were brought in

00:13:47.710 --> 00:13:51.220
and the Court's authority was
entrenched firmly upon this land,

00:13:51.220 --> 00:13:54.010
the Emperor has tried to rob the
Kugutsu of our power and strength.

00:13:55.120 --> 00:13:57.920
While no one has dared say this,

00:13:57.920 --> 00:14:00.390
it is clear the storyteller of
the Gasaraki legend

00:14:00.390 --> 00:14:02.760
was somehow murdered
by the Emperor.

00:14:03.800 --> 00:14:06.160
Even the ceremony of the kugai...

00:14:06.160 --> 00:14:07.630
Those are groundless suspicions!

00:14:08.970 --> 00:14:10.430
My father...

00:14:11.070 --> 00:14:19.140
Our headsmen spoke of how the Court
would never undermine our clan.

00:14:22.450 --> 00:14:27.510
While the ceremony was disrupted,
there's no doubt that Yushiro...

00:14:36.060 --> 00:14:38.660
No doubt to all those who witnessed
the duel that Noble Yushiro's kugai

00:14:38.660 --> 00:14:41.230
was victorious over
Maiden Miharu's kugai.

00:14:41.230 --> 00:14:46.940
I am aware you were to be
wed to Yushiro.

00:14:46.940 --> 00:14:49.210
My reservations are rooted
in other concerns!

00:14:49.210 --> 00:14:52.110
Then, why did you not raise
your voice before?

00:14:53.280 --> 00:14:57.540
I doubt that I would be alive
now if I had done so!

00:15:01.120 --> 00:15:02.590
I see.

00:15:03.190 --> 00:15:05.320
It seems your loyalty hinges
upon whether or not

00:15:05.320 --> 00:15:08.620
you find my decision to your liking.

00:15:10.030 --> 00:15:15.230
No matter, but hold these words
close to your heart!

00:15:16.570 --> 00:15:21.140
Recall how the Emperor usurped
the kingdom of the Wa

00:15:21.140 --> 00:15:22.610
to reign over this land.

00:15:24.010 --> 00:15:28.980
The Court made the ceremonies and
legends of the Chikushi their own.

00:15:28.980 --> 00:15:35.490
As long as our gods are alive,
our clan shall persevere.

00:15:35.490 --> 00:15:41.520
But once we lose our gods, we
have no choice but to perish.

00:15:42.360 --> 00:15:44.560
The kugai are the vehicles
of our gods,

00:15:44.560 --> 00:15:47.930
the brave oni able to vanquish the
anger of the giant Shiyuu,

00:15:47.930 --> 00:15:51.160
and the last entities upon
which we can rely.

00:15:51.740 --> 00:15:55.300
The Court knew the significance of
the edict they handed down.

00:15:58.780 --> 00:16:03.440
But how are we to rebel
against the Emperor?

00:16:04.050 --> 00:16:07.720
The capital's northern wall alone is
guarded by over a thousand men.

00:16:07.720 --> 00:16:11.720
We will amount to no more
than two hundred.

00:16:11.720 --> 00:16:14.060
We take the kugai to the capital.

00:16:14.060 --> 00:16:15.160
The kugai?

00:16:15.160 --> 00:16:17.060
Into the capital?

00:16:21.870 --> 00:16:25.430
Our guardian oni gods shall join
us on the field of battle!

00:16:26.300 --> 00:16:28.240
We will make the Court remember
our true nature.

00:16:28.940 --> 00:16:31.710
Make them tremble again
with the terror

00:16:31.710 --> 00:16:35.340
that they have forgotten for over
three hundred years.

00:16:35.880 --> 00:16:37.250
The kai have fallen.

00:16:37.250 --> 00:16:39.350
The kai have forgotten their duties
as masters of ceremony.

00:16:39.350 --> 00:16:42.380
Why should we hesitate to evoke
them in the service of war?

00:16:52.430 --> 00:16:56.200
Listen, you must make the rounds to
all sixteen houses before dawn.

00:16:56.770 --> 00:16:59.840
All of the Watanabe faction shall rally
and lay siege to the capital.

00:16:59.840 --> 00:17:02.200
Assemble at the estate of Lord Tsuna
tomorrow morning.

00:17:20.460 --> 00:17:22.230
As you have just heard,

00:17:22.230 --> 00:17:25.300
we, the Watanabe faction,
and all our followers

00:17:25.300 --> 00:17:28.030
shall rally to lay siege to the capital.

00:17:29.000 --> 00:17:31.540
A repeat of your disgraceful
performance at the Threshold

00:17:31.540 --> 00:17:35.240
will not be tolerated!

00:17:35.240 --> 00:17:38.330
The kugai are born out of the
ceremony of the Gasaraki.

00:17:39.440 --> 00:17:45.120
We know not if they were willed
upon us by the Gasaraki,

00:17:45.120 --> 00:17:46.910
or they embody our karma.

00:17:47.850 --> 00:17:51.250
But of this much there is no doubt...

00:17:53.020 --> 00:17:57.260
With their presence, they
caused a rift among us,

00:17:57.260 --> 00:18:02.700
and this rift was exploited
by the Emperor.

00:18:02.700 --> 00:18:06.140
No doubt intent on manipulating
the squabbles

00:18:06.140 --> 00:18:08.400
so that we might annihilate
one another.

00:18:09.370 --> 00:18:11.540
The ceremony of the kugai!

00:18:14.180 --> 00:18:16.810
A vehicle of divine manifestation?

00:18:16.810 --> 00:18:18.320
Purge your mind of such thoughts.

00:18:18.320 --> 00:18:22.590
Worshippers will rally around their
vehicle for divine possession,

00:18:22.590 --> 00:18:24.890
and force their righteousness
upon others.

00:18:25.460 --> 00:18:27.990
Such is the true nature
of gods among us.

00:18:27.990 --> 00:18:29.980
Our vehicles are no different.

00:18:36.500 --> 00:18:37.970
Hear me!

00:18:43.340 --> 00:18:44.780
That is the kugai!

00:18:44.780 --> 00:18:47.970
The sound of the kugai guiding the
blacksmith to mend themselves!

00:18:52.780 --> 00:18:54.410
The gods of war?

00:18:57.820 --> 00:19:01.190
In the end, legends are but
the creation of men,

00:19:01.190 --> 00:19:03.460
and yet even that has
come to an end.

00:19:04.000 --> 00:19:06.520
For it is you, of all men, that
drew the curtain close!

00:19:12.200 --> 00:19:14.330
You broke the ceremony.

00:19:14.940 --> 00:19:17.280
The kai, an embodiment and
vessel of the Gasaraki,

00:19:17.280 --> 00:19:19.180
himself disrupted the ceremony.

00:19:19.780 --> 00:19:24.080
No longer will the kugai represent
the will of the gods.

00:19:24.080 --> 00:19:28.090
Alas, the kugai are back
to what they were.

00:19:28.090 --> 00:19:29.610
What they were?

00:19:32.260 --> 00:19:35.250
Tools of war! Kugai are
but tools of war!

00:19:35.830 --> 00:19:39.820
We aspire to challenge the heavens
as proud warriors!

00:19:49.940 --> 00:19:53.070
Prepare yourself.
We depart tomorrow.

00:20:17.670 --> 00:20:18.860
How elegant.

00:20:51.800 --> 00:20:53.270
Lily bells...

00:20:54.010 --> 00:20:59.170
Why? Why did you not take my
life on the Threshold?

00:21:00.040 --> 00:21:01.510
I do not know.

00:21:02.350 --> 00:21:04.250
My fate was sealed there.

00:21:05.120 --> 00:21:07.950
Back then. Back there.

00:21:07.950 --> 00:21:10.610
But I could not bring myself to.

00:21:11.460 --> 00:21:14.190
I could not bring myself
to take your life.

00:21:14.890 --> 00:21:16.730
If you had beheaded me then,

00:21:16.730 --> 00:21:20.090
as it is prescribed in the
protocol of ceremony,

00:21:22.030 --> 00:21:24.800
then I would not have known of you.

00:21:25.870 --> 00:21:28.340
I would not have known
of such heartache.

00:21:36.810 --> 00:21:41.080
Kugai... All I possess is the kugai.

00:21:41.950 --> 00:21:44.620
I am a kai. I...

00:21:47.890 --> 00:21:51.760
I set forth into battle, as a kai!

00:21:51.760 --> 00:21:53.230
Miharu...

00:22:08.850 --> 00:22:11.870
I myself have now come
to know you as well.

00:22:13.280 --> 00:22:14.920
The Kugutsu,

00:22:14.920 --> 00:22:18.320
puppeteers manipulating the
world from the shadows.

00:22:19.420 --> 00:22:23.950
Today we return to our true nature!

00:22:27.190 --> 00:22:32.010
Hark

00:22:33.170 --> 00:22:38.460
It's time I journey

00:22:41.990 --> 00:22:49.130
Break apart my heart

00:22:49.300 --> 00:22:55.660
For crimson sadness

00:22:55.990 --> 00:23:03.170
Pours out from it

00:23:03.380 --> 00:23:07.090
I can only, oh

00:23:07.200 --> 00:23:10.280
Close my eyes, oh

00:23:10.370 --> 00:23:15.890
I pray, let this break apart

00:23:31.110 --> 00:23:34.990
I can only, oh

00:23:35.080 --> 00:23:38.140
Close my eyes, oh

00:23:38.210 --> 00:23:43.340
I pray, let this break apart

00:23:44.870 --> 00:23:51.320
I beg you, be by my side

00:23:59.790 --> 00:24:01.450
I was always alone.

00:24:02.490 --> 00:24:05.950
I was always alone looking
to my older brother.

00:24:06.530 --> 00:24:09.360
Then one day it dawned upon me.

00:24:09.970 --> 00:24:14.030
All that I'd been looking upon was
my older brother's back.

00:24:15.240 --> 00:24:16.740
Scorched by my karma

00:24:16.740 --> 00:24:19.140
I witness the inferno of
the ancient city

00:24:19.140 --> 00:24:22.080
The red glare challenges the
sky with naked savagery

00:24:22.710 --> 00:24:26.810
I sank my heart into the depths of the
Threshold a millennium ago.
